{"ID":"20240205153701-d72n15c","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240205153701-d72n15c","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205153701-d72n15c\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206140952-e4p09ff\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240614112930-kf9clls\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:4130,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206140952-e4p09ff\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":"370补13没药","type":"doc","updated":"20240828141314"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206140952-e4p09ff","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206140952-e4p09ff","updated":"20240704144842"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】\t天然没药：呈不规则颗粒性团块，大小不一，大者直径长达6cm以上。表面黄棕色或红棕色，近半透明部分呈棕黑色，被有黄色粉尘。质坚脆，破碎面不整齐，无光泽；有特异香气，味苦而微辛。\n胶质没药：成不规则块状，多黏结成大小不等的团块。表面深棕色或黄棕色，不透明；质坚实或疏松。味苦而有黏性。\n【性味】\t辛、苦，平。\n【功效】\t散血去瘀，消肿定痛。\n【炙品】\t制没药：不规则形的团块或小块，长1"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBackslashContent","Data":"~"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2cm。表面黑棕色至黑褐色，粗糙，质硬，破碎面棕褐色；气香特异，味苦。\n醋没药：小碎块状或圆颗粒状，表面黑褐色或棕黑色，油亮，有醋气。\n炒没药：形如醋没药，表面有光泽，气微香。"}]},{"ID":"20240206140953-g54euwe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206140953-g54euwe","updated":"20240206140953"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206140953-lgbbxjr.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240205163315-24z0j5j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205163315-24z0j5j","updated":"20240205163315"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"没药"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/没药-20240205163315-qu1vzgn.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240704150108-8xrl7nm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240704150108-8xrl7nm","updated":"20240828141300"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 590px;","style":"width: 580px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"没药6"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/没药6-20240704150108-q00tzvy.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 580px;\" parent-style=\"width: 590px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 446px;","style":"width: 436px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"没药7"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/没药7-20240704150113-nxp1abq.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 436px;\" parent-style=\"width: 446px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"}]},{"ID":"20240704150053-vs68qs8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240704150053-vs68qs8","updated":"20240828141301"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 451px;","style":"width: 441px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"没药8"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/没药8-20240704150338-h23tf65.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 441px;\" parent-style=\"width: 451px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 451px;","style":"width: 441px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"没药4"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/没药4-20240704150053-ppk3qg2.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 441px;\" parent-style=\"width: 451px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​​​​"}]},{"ID":"20240704145151-2l2whbl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240704145151-2l2whbl","updated":"20240828141314"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 777px;","style":"width: 767px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240704145151-1gbfady.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 767px;\" parent-style=\"width: 777px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 394px;","style":"width: 384px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"没药5"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/没药5-20240704150058-ox4vvgp.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 384px;\" parent-style=\"width: 394px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240704145915-g8czfuo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240704145915-g8czfuo","updated":"20240828141307"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"没药1"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/没药1-20240704145915-q0j3x7f.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240704145833-gupzzw2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240704145833-gupzzw2","updated":"20240828141311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"没药3"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/没药3-20240704145831-mcp03lg.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"}]},{"ID":"20240614113337-63cjnhx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113337-63cjnhx","updated":"20240704145244"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"注：没药为没药树的树脂。（为橄榄科植物地丁树或哈地丁树的干燥树脂。）"}]},{"ID":"20240614113349-dregb4d","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614113349-dregb4d"}},{"ID":"20240614113415-djkr76t","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614113415-djkr76t","updated":"20240614113421"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"没药《本草图经》"}]},{"ID":"20240614113415-7e40fe6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113415-7e40fe6","updated":"20240614113418"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"没药"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，生波斯国，今海南诸国及广州或有之。木之根株，皆如橄榄，叶青而密。岁久者，则有膏液流滴在地下，凝结成块，或大或小，亦类安息香。采无时。今方多用治妇人内伤痛楚，又治血晕及脐腹 刺者。没药一物，研细，温酒调一钱便止。又治历节诸风骨节疼痛，昼夜不可忍者。没药半两研，虎胫骨三两涂酥炙黄色，先捣罗为散，与没药同研令细，温酒调二钱，日三服。大佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240614113349-2qcxxqw","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614113349-2qcxxqw"}},{"ID":"20240614113402-ebikphs","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614113402-ebikphs","updated":"20240614113410"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"没药《顾松园医镜》"}]},{"ID":"20240614113402-oron1j5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113402-oron1j5","updated":"20240614113402"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔辛苦平，入肝经。制法同乳香。〕散血止诸痛，〔凡胸腹胁肋骨节筋痛，不由血瘀，而因于血虚者忌之。〕通滞消诸肿。〔热瘀血滞则气壅，故经络满急，发肿作痛。善通壅滞，则血行而气畅，肿自消，痛自止，故为外科折伤家之要品。〕祛恶露，止血晕，〔善入血分而行瘀。〕可攻目翳，〔散肝经之血热，则赤痛除而翳退矣。〕堪除血痢。乳香活血，没药散血，皆能止痛消肿，故每相兼用之。"}]},{"ID":"20240614113402-394izun","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113402-394izun","updated":"20240614113404"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"产后恶露去多，痈疽已溃，法宜禁之。孕妇勿服，以其堕胎也。"}]},{"ID":"20240614113349-kjsso53","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614113349-kjsso53"}},{"ID":"20240614113350-jfp85cg","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614113350-jfp85cg","updated":"20240614113358"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"没药《中药炮制》"}]},{"ID":"20240614113350-a9vd2bi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113350-a9vd2bi","updated":"20240614113350"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"『来源』本品为橄榄科植物"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"没药树"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"或"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"爱伦堡没药树"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的干燥胶树脂。"}]},{"ID":"20240614113350-bvsv5ed","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113350-bvsv5ed","updated":"20240614113350"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"『产地』土耳其、叙利亚、非洲等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240614113350-q61in11","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113350-q61in11","updated":"20240614113350"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"『采收季节』春夏采收。"}]},{"ID":"20240614113350-ej6bpd6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113350-ej6bpd6","updated":"20240614113350"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"『炮制方法』将没药大的，应捶成小块，分为大、中、小，按档分开炒，以免大小颗粒混同炒之不匀。将铁锅烧热投入没药，微火炒至锅内见油，投入灯草（药1斤，灯草150克），炒至末药不粘灯草，色枯起锅，倾入石板或木板上压平，切成四分小块。"}]},{"ID":"20240614113350-cwhlbkx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113350-cwhlbkx","updated":"20240614113350"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"『用量』3～9克。"}]},{"ID":"20240614113350-v3hkkyf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113350-v3hkkyf","updated":"20240614113350"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"『贮存』装铁箱内加盖。"}]},{"ID":"20240614113338-8aoyxw3","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614113338-8aoyxw3"}},{"ID":"20240614113339-ugbmxzg","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614113339-ugbmxzg","updated":"20240614113345"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"没药《本草简要方》"}]},{"ID":"20240614113339-zjx4rst","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113339-zjx4rst","updated":"20240614113339"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主治。破血。止痛消肿。生肌。去目翳。疗损伤晕痛。心胆虚弱。肝血不足。症瘕。痔漏。妇人产后血气痛。堕胎下血。血晕腹痛。及杖疮筋骨损伤。诸恶疮。没药丸。没药（另研）蛮姜玄胡索干漆（炒）当归桂心牛膝丹皮干姜各等分。研末。醋煮面和丸梧子大。每服十至十五丸。神曲煎汤下。治产后心胸烦躁。恶血不快。又方。没药（另研）桃仁（炒另研）各二钱五分。当归一两。桂心白芍各五钱。虻虫（去足翅炒）水蛭（炒焦）各三十枚。研末。"}]},{"ID":"20240614113339-ge40wnr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113339-ge40wnr","updated":"20240614113339"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"醋煮米糊丸豌豆大每服三丸。淡醋汤下。治产后恶露忽断。骤作寒热脐腹百脉痛如锥刺。又方。"}]},{"ID":"20240614113339-7sg0fw4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113339-7sg0fw4","updated":"20240614113339"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"没药乳香川芎川椒赤芍当归各五钱。自然铜（醋淬七次）二钱五分。研末。黄蜡二两。熔开入药末不住手搅匀。丸如弹子大。每服一丸好酒化开煎至五分。热服。治中石疽。打扑内损。"}]},{"ID":"20240614113339-oq60aoh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113339-oq60aoh","updated":"20240614113339"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"筋骨疼痛。没药降圣丹。没药（另研）当归（酒洗焙）白芍骨碎补（炒去毛）生川乌自然铜（醋淬十二次。研末水飞焙）各一两。生地川芎各一两五钱。研末。生姜自然汁和蜜。每一两作四丸。每服一丸。槌碎。水酒各半钟。加苏木少许。煎至八分。空腹服。治营卫虚弱。筋骨缓纵。皮肉刺痛。肩背拘急。及打扑损伤。筋断骨折。挛急疼痛。不能屈伸者。没药散。"}]},{"ID":"20240614113339-8h9e9qo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113339-8h9e9qo","updated":"20240614113339"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"没药（另研）红花玄胡索（炒）当归各等分。研末。每服二钱。童便黄酒各半盏。煎服治妇人血气疼痛不可忍。又方。没药干蝎（炒）天南星（炮）白附子（炮）雄黄（另研）当归（焙）丹砂（另研）胡黄连牛黄（另研）麝香（另研）白芷官桂丁香炙草各二钱五分。乌蛇（酒浸去皮骨炙）五钱。"}]},{"ID":"20240614113339-aoggkw4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113339-aoggkw4","updated":"20240614113339"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"研末。每服五分。温酒调下。早晚二次。治风冷搏于肺脏。上攻鼻痛。又方。没药（另研）干山药五加皮桂心防风羌活白附子（炮）骨碎补白芷苍耳（炒）自然铜（醋炙）各五钱。血竭（另研）二钱五分。虎胫骨（酥炙）龟板（醋炙）各一两。研末。酒煮面和丸梧子大。每服二十丸。"}]},{"ID":"20240614113339-moi9gl4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113339-moi9gl4","updated":"20240614113339"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"空腹温酒下。日二次。治风毒走注疼痛四肢麻痹。又方。没药血竭桂心玄胡索当归蒲黄红花干漆（炒烟尽）木香芍药各等分。研末。每服二钱。食前温酒调下。治妇人一切血气脐腹撮痛。产后儿枕块痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240614113251-0fmjop9","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614113251-0fmjop9"}},{"ID":"20240614113329-05o7qqu","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614113329-05o7qqu","updated":"20240614113333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"没药《汤液本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240614113329-cuhh46b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113329-cuhh46b","updated":"20240614113329"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦、平。无毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240614113329-cl6eru7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113329-cl6eru7","updated":"20240614113329"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本草》云∶主破血止痛，疗金疮杖疮，诸恶疮，痔漏卒下血，目中翳，晕痛，肤赤。"}]},{"ID":"20240614113329-vih2biz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113329-vih2biz","updated":"20240614113329"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生波斯国，似安息香，其块大小不定，黑色。"}]},{"ID":"20240614113252-ya8i513","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614113252-ya8i513"}},{"ID":"20240614113320-vkzyzp7","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614113320-vkzyzp7","updated":"20240614113324"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"没药《玉楸药解》"}]},{"ID":"20240614113320-jib0at6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113320-jib0at6","updated":"20240614113320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦，气平，入足厥阴肝经。破血止痛，消肿生肌。"}]},{"ID":"20240614113320-fsf8mja","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113320-fsf8mja","updated":"20240614113320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"没药破血行瘀，化老血宿癥，治痈疽痔漏、金疮杖疮、跌扑损伤、一切血瘀肿痛。疗经期产后、心腹疼痛诸证。"}]},{"ID":"20240614113320-spu4clp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113320-spu4clp","updated":"20240614113320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"制同乳香。"}]},{"ID":"20240614113252-twti1sa","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614113252-twti1sa"}},{"ID":"20240614113310-g20mi7c","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614113310-g20mi7c","updated":"20240614113315"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"没药《本草撮要》"}]},{"ID":"20240614113310-id31smd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113310-id31smd","updated":"20240614113310"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦．入足厥阴经．功专破血止痛．得乳香治跌扑损伤肿痛．得虎胫骨治历节风痛．孕妇忌．"}]},{"ID":"20240614113252-nglfjhn","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614113252-nglfjhn"}},{"ID":"20240614113302-czgddlg","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614113302-czgddlg","updated":"20240614113306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"没药《得配本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240614113302-9rqsmfy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113302-9rqsmfy","updated":"20240614113302"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"苦，平。微寒。入十二经血分。乳香功专活血而定痛，没药功专散血而消肿。得虎胫骨，治历节风痛。配血竭、童便，去产后恶血。"}]},{"ID":"20240614113302-uy9t4yk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113302-uy9t4yk","updated":"20240614113302"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"箬上烘去油，同灯心研则细。痈疽已溃，血虚腹痛，孕妇，三者禁用。"}]},{"ID":"20240614113302-e69pp6w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113302-e69pp6w","updated":"20240614113302"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"气血疼痛，疮毒壅肿，皆用乳、没治之。盖血滞则气瘀，气瘀则经络满，故痛而且肿，得乳、没以通其气血，肿痛自除。然气血之瘀滞，亦有气虚不行、血虚不动者。有邪气入于肌肉，致气血凝滞者。宜审其虚实，或补或散，以乳、没为佐，勿专恃散血活血之剂以为功也。"}]},{"ID":"20240614113252-f4wninz","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614113252-f4wninz"}},{"ID":"20240614113253-2501fd8","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614113253-2501fd8","updated":"20240614113257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"没药《本经逢原》"}]},{"ID":"20240614113253-7stflpn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113253-7stflpn","updated":"20240614113253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"苦平无毒。修治与乳香同。"}]},{"ID":"20240614113253-91eqwqc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113253-91eqwqc","updated":"20240614113253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"发明"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"乳香活血，没药散血，皆能止痛消肿生肌，故二药每每相兼为用。凡刃伤打损坠马，并宜热酒调服。若妊妇胎气不安勿用，产后恶露去多腹中虚痛，痈疽已溃而痛，及筋骨胸腹诸痛，若不因瘀血者，皆不可服。"}]},{"ID":"20240614113130-cl6m9z5","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614113130-cl6m9z5"}},{"ID":"20240614113243-osap7ki","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614113243-osap7ki","updated":"20240614113247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"没药《本草述钩元》"}]},{"ID":"20240614113243-0cwmwb3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113243-0cwmwb3","updated":"20240614113243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出波斯及海南。今广州亦有之。其木岁久脂溢。下地凝块。大小不等。色赤黑而明者良。"}]},{"ID":"20240614113243-mte4nt8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113243-mte4nt8","updated":"20240614113243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦气平。气薄味浓。阴也。降也。入足厥阴经。通滞血。散瘀壅。（滞血不去。其气壅瘀女子发。"}]},{"ID":"20240614113243-jbs2984","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113243-jbs2984","updated":"20240614113243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"筋骨疼清肌解热作汤。送夏枯草忍治内伤半两各半服之。"}]},{"ID":"20240614113243-onn9jka","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113243-onn9jka","updated":"20240614113243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"方速。"}]},{"ID":"20240614113243-ynyxq46","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113243-ynyxq46","updated":"20240614113243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔论〕仲淳谓乳香禀于木火。没药禀于金水。观乎乳取紫赤。没取赤黑。赤火黑水。"}]},{"ID":"20240614113243-99o8zd6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113243-99o8zd6","updated":"20240614113243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"则木之阳以阳气孕妇不宜服。凡痛因血虚。而非瘀血停留者。不宜。痈疽已溃者。不宜。目赤肤翳非血热甚〔修治〕与乳香同。"}]},{"ID":"20240614113130-i25q6vu","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614113130-i25q6vu"}},{"ID":"20240614113231-mqe3stm","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614113231-mqe3stm","updated":"20240614113237"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"没药《本草衍义》"}]},{"ID":"20240614113231-v32ct46","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113231-v32ct46","updated":"20240614113231"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大概通滞血，打扑损疼痛，皆以酒化服。血滞则气壅淤，气壅淤则经络满急，经络满急，故痛且肿。凡打扑着肌肉须肿胀者，经络伤，气血不行，壅淤，故如是。"}]},{"ID":"20240614113130-wc7lmjs","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614113130-wc7lmjs"}},{"ID":"20240614113223-78e02jl","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614113223-78e02jl","updated":"20240614113226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"没药《本草纲目》"}]},{"ID":"20240614113223-9z1jbx9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113223-9z1jbx9","updated":"20240614113223"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「释名」末药。"}]},{"ID":"20240614113223-71m3a9l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113223-71m3a9l","updated":"20240614113223"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「气味」苦、平、无毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240614113223-929nfoe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113223-929nfoe","updated":"20240614113223"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「主治」"}]},{"ID":"20240614113223-bewz7ui","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113223-bewz7ui","updated":"20240614113223"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、关节疼痛。用没药末半两、虎胫骨（酥炙，研末）三两，和匀，每服二钱，温酒调下。"}]},{"ID":"20240614113223-bxsor1g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113223-bxsor1g","updated":"20240614113223"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、筋骨损伤。用米粉四两，炒黄，加入没药、乳香末各半两，酒调成膏，摊贴痛处。"}]},{"ID":"20240614113223-0932fpd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113223-0932fpd","updated":"20240614113223"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3、刀伤。用乳香、没药各一钱，以童便半碗、酒半碗，温化服下。"}]},{"ID":"20240614113223-ok8r70r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113223-ok8r70r","updated":"20240614113223"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4、妇女务晕。用没药末一钱，酒送服。"}]},{"ID":"20240614113223-7h82zi3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113223-7h82zi3","updated":"20240614113223"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5、产后恶血。用没药、血竭末各一钱，童便、温酒各半碗，煎开后送服。过一阵再服一次，恶血自下。"}]},{"ID":"20240614113130-on5baw5","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614113130-on5baw5"}},{"ID":"20240614113211-lk6x55v","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614113211-lk6x55v","updated":"20240614113217"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"没药《证类本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240614113211-shlijaq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113211-shlijaq","updated":"20240614113211"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦，平，无毒。主破血止痛，疗金疮杖疮，诸恶疮痔漏，卒下血，目中翳晕痛肤赤。生波斯国。似安息香，其块大小不定，黑色。（今附）臣禹锡等谨按药性论云∶没药单用亦得。"}]},{"ID":"20240614113211-mgbbvf6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113211-mgbbvf6","updated":"20240614113211"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦、辛。能主打 损，心腹血瘀，伤折 跌，筋骨瘀痛，金刃所损，痛不可忍。皆以酒投饮之。良。日华子云∶破症结，宿血，消肿毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240614113211-m8rf28r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113211-m8rf28r","updated":"20240614113211"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"图经曰∶没药，生波斯国，今海南诸国及广州或有之。木之根之株皆如橄榄，叶青而密。"}]},{"ID":"20240614113211-05mp991","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113211-05mp991","updated":"20240614113211"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"岁久者，则有膏液流滴在地下，凝结成块，或大或小，亦类安息香。采无时。今方∶多用治妇人内伤痛楚，又治血晕及脐腹 刺者。没药一物，研细，温酒调一钱，便止。又治历节诸风，骨节疼痛，昼夜不可忍者。没药半两，研，虎胫骨三两涂酥炙黄色，先捣罗为散，与没药同研令细。温酒调二钱，日三服，大佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240614113211-hx16kbp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113211-hx16kbp","updated":"20240614113211"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"海药∶谨按徐表《南州记》∶生波斯国，是彼处松脂也。状如神香，赤黑色。味苦、辛，温，无毒。主折伤马坠，推陈置新，能生好血。凡服皆须研烂，以热酒调服，近效。堕胎心腹俱痛及野鸡漏痔，产后血气痛，并宜丸散中服尔。"}]},{"ID":"20240614113211-tz534pq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113211-tz534pq","updated":"20240614113211"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"衍义曰∶没药，大概通滞血。打扑损疼痛，皆以酒化服。血滞则气壅淤，气壅淤则经络满急，经络满急故痛且肿。凡打扑着肌肉须肿胀者，经络伤，气血不行壅淤，故如是。"}]},{"ID":"20240614113130-ll4t0ym","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614113130-ll4t0ym"}},{"ID":"20240614113159-l8iyn0m","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614113159-l8iyn0m","updated":"20240614113203"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"没药《本草新编》"}]},{"ID":"20240614113159-ybpp10u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113159-ybpp10u","updated":"20240614113159"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"没药，味苦、辛，气平，无毒。入脾、肾二经。消肿突恶疮、痈疽溃腐，破血止痛如神，疗坠堕跌打损伤尤效。亦内、外可用之药，而外治更奇也。"}]},{"ID":"20240614113159-buhoop5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113159-buhoop5","updated":"20240614113159"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"没药亦有赝者，尤难辨。辨法亦投之水中，立时色黯者为真，否则假物，无益于用，不如勿用也。"}]},{"ID":"20240614113130-s4ur25o","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614113130-s4ur25o"}},{"ID":"20240614113146-xq55avc","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614113146-xq55avc","updated":"20240614113150"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"没药《本草备要》"}]},{"ID":"20240614113146-v27wjvq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113146-v27wjvq","updated":"20240614113146"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"宣，散瘀，定痛"}]},{"ID":"20240614113146-p3y4a5t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113146-p3y4a5t","updated":"20240614113146"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"苦平（《经疏》云∶应兼辛）。入十二经。散结气，通滞血，消肿定痛生肌（寇宗 曰∶血滞则气壅，气壅则经络满急，故肿且痛），补心胆虚，肝血不足（推陈致新，能生好血）。"}]},{"ID":"20240614113146-a57gf8m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113146-a57gf8m","updated":"20240614113146"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"治金疮杖疮（血肉受伤，故瘀而发热作痛），恶疮痔漏，翳晕目赤（肝经血热），产后血气痛，破症堕胎（乳香活血，没药散血，皆能消肿止痛生肌，故每兼用。疮疽已溃者忌用，脓多者勿敷）。出诸南番。赤色、类于琥珀者良。主治与乳香同。"}]},{"ID":"20240614113130-edmxf6c","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614113130-edmxf6c"}},{"ID":"20240614113131-snhyll3","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614113131-snhyll3","updated":"20240614113141"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"没药《医学入门》"}]},{"ID":"20240614113131-kf8kfng","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113131-kf8kfng","updated":"20240614113131"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"没药苦平疗疮痍，破血止痛最为奇，腹心筋骨疼皆用，产后金疮也相宜。"}]},{"ID":"20240614113131-4ohwcjv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113131-4ohwcjv","updated":"20240614113131"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"没，沦没也。木之膏液没入地中凝结成块，大小不一，亦波斯国松脂也。但其色黑，无毒。东垣云∶没药在治疮散血之科。凡血滞则气壅，经络满急而作痛肿，此药推陈致新，故能破宿血，消肿止痛，为疮家奇药也。又治妇人内伤 结，脐腹 刺，堕胎，心腹俱痛，产后血晕、血气痛及历节诸风，骨节疼痛，一切金疮、杖疮、打扑折伤皆宜。兼治卒下血，目中翳晕肤赤。制同乳香。"}]},{"ID":"20240614112915-njlxkjx","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614112915-njlxkjx"}},{"ID":"20240614113118-pnqs8j7","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614113118-pnqs8j7","updated":"20240614113124"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"没药《本草便读》"}]},{"ID":"20240614113118-c6eump6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113118-c6eump6","updated":"20240614113118"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"活血与乳香相仿．性利能宣．行瘀则没药为长．味平而苦．（没药亦树脂也．味苦平．其治虽与乳香相仿．而行瘀散血．则没药独擅其长．故能治金疮杖疮症瘕痈肿等证．所以能止痛者．血瘀则痛．气壅亦痛也．外科药用之．其理概可想见．）"}]},{"ID":"20240614112915-vyacrfr","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614112915-vyacrfr"}},{"ID":"20240614113109-jk2dry5","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614113109-jk2dry5","updated":"20240614113112"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"没药《本草征要》"}]},{"ID":"20240614113109-t2no3gb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113109-t2no3gb","updated":"20240614113109"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦，性平，无毒。入肝经。制法同乳香。"}]},{"ID":"20240614113109-zhva0ln","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113109-zhva0ln","updated":"20240614113109"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"宣血气之滞，医疮腐之疼。可攻目翳，堪堕胎儿。"}]},{"ID":"20240614113109-o5nltb9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113109-o5nltb9","updated":"20240614113109"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"血滞则气壅，故经络满急，发肿作痛。没药善通壅滞，和血去瘀，则血行而气畅痛止也。"}]},{"ID":"20240614113109-b6ujdf0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113109-b6ujdf0","updated":"20240614113109"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"骨节痛与胸腹筋痛，不由血瘀，而因于血虚；产后恶露去多，腹中虚痛；痈"}]},{"ID":"20240614113109-khyak54","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113109-khyak54","updated":"20240614113109"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"疽已溃，法咸禁之。"}]},{"ID":"20240614113109-v3du3ag","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113109-v3du3ag","updated":"20240614113109"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"乳香偏于调气，没药偏于散血，二者每相兼而用。"}]},{"ID":"20240614112915-at4gv2z","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614112915-at4gv2z"}},{"ID":"20240614113100-h05jsum","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614113100-h05jsum","updated":"20240614113104"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"没药《本草从新》"}]},{"ID":"20240614113100-60i49eq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113100-60i49eq","updated":"20240614113100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"一名末药．宣、散瘀定痛．"}]},{"ID":"20240614113100-s4smki3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113100-s4smki3","updated":"20240614113100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"苦平．入十二经，散结气，通滞血，消肿定痛．（血滞则气壅、气壅则经络满急、故肿且痛．）生肌．（推陈致新、能生好血．）治金疮杖疮．恶疮痔漏．翳晕目赤．（肝经瘀热．）产后血气痛．破症堕胎．（乳香活血、没药散瘀、皆能消肿、止痛、生肌、故每兼用．）诸痛不由血瘀．而由血虚．产后恶露去多．腹中虚痛．痈疽已溃．法当咸禁．出诸南番．色赤类琥珀者良．制法同上．（筋骨损伤、米粉四两、炒黄、入没药乳香末各半两、酒调成膏、摊贴之．）"}]},{"ID":"20240614112915-in5jg4d","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614112915-in5jg4d"}},{"ID":"20240614113051-c86p12d","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614113051-c86p12d","updated":"20240614113055"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"没药《增广和剂局方药性总论》"}]},{"ID":"20240614113051-omym3yw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113051-omym3yw","updated":"20240614113051"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦，平，无毒。主破血止痛，疗金疮，杖疮，诸恶疮，痔漏卒下血，目中翳晕痛，赤。《药性论》云∶单用亦得。味苦辛。能主打 损，心腹血瘀，伤折 跌，筋骨疼痛，刃所损痛不可忍，皆以酒投饮之，良。日华子云∶破症结，宿血，消肿毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240614112915-qhl19gp","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614112915-qhl19gp"}},{"ID":"20240614113041-5v29rst","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614113041-5v29rst","updated":"20240614113045"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"没药《本草求真》"}]},{"ID":"20240614113041-bnngefq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113041-bnngefq","updated":"20240614113041"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（香木）入心破血宣瘀止痛"}]},{"ID":"20240614113041-nwoaf6r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113041-nwoaf6r","updated":"20240614113041"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"没药（专入心。兼入肝。）苦平兼辛。诸书亦载能补心胆与肝。盖谓瘀血不除。则新血安生。乳香气味辛温。既能行气活血。又有没药之苦以破其瘀。则推陈致新。自有补益之妙。（宗曰。没药大概通滞血。血滞则气壅瘀。气壅瘀则经络满急。经络满急故痛且肿。凡打扑跌。皆伤经络。气血不行。瘀壅作肿痛也。）是以古方。乳香必同没药兼施。（生肌散每每相兼而用。）谓其可止疼痛。义由此也。今人不明药品气味。动以书载补益。岂不误甚？出南香色赤类琥珀者良。治同乳香。"}]},{"ID":"20240614112915-wvs4euz","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614112915-wvs4euz"}},{"ID":"20240614113030-w6maxyk","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614113030-w6maxyk","updated":"20240614113036"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"没药《本草乘雅半偈》"}]},{"ID":"20240614113030-nf6603w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113030-nf6603w","updated":"20240614113030"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（宋开宝）"}]},{"ID":"20240614113030-e1d2sma","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113030-e1d2sma","updated":"20240614113030"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【气味】苦平，无毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240614113030-goy2h2f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113030-goy2h2f","updated":"20240614113030"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【主治】主破血，止痛，疗金疮，杖疮，诸恶疮，痔漏，卒下血，目中翳晕肤赤痛。久服舒筋膜，通血脉，固齿牙，长须发。"}]},{"ID":"20240614113030-0i9ms6q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113030-0i9ms6q","updated":"20240614113030"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【核】曰∶出波斯，及海南，今广州亦有之。其木根株，俱似橄榄。叶青茂密。岁久者，脂溢下地，凝结成块，色黑而香，状似安息。市肆多用松脂、沥清，伪造入药，殊为患也。"}]},{"ID":"20240614113030-okcobo7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614113030-okcobo7","updated":"20240614113030"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【 】曰∶没药，谐声也。水中有所取，曰没。屈伸俯仰，缀兆舒疾之文；出于中，散于外，曰乐。盖人身精血膏液，涕唾汗溺之属，皆归于水，如水中有眚，则灌溉之用不行，致筋不转，脉不摇，齿不生，发不长矣。亦即屈伸俯仰，缀兆舒疾之文，不出于中，不散于外矣。没药功力，能入水有取，若眚翳除，而筋转，而脉摇，而齿生发长，成合自繇。岂复有罔发于中，失散于外，为症瘕，为疮疡，为痔漏，为恶血，为翳膜肤赤之患。"}]},{"ID":"20240614112915-czgnocc","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614112915-czgnocc"}},{"ID":"20240614112930-gevhbco","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614112930-gevhbco","updated":"20240614112944"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"没药《中药学》"}]},{"ID":"20240614112930-0o7wnzc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112930-0o7wnzc","updated":"20240614112930"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【药用】橄榄科灌木或小乔木没药树CommiphoramyrrhaEngl.及其同属植物中取得的干燥胶树脂。"}]},{"ID":"20240614112930-kf9clls","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112930-kf9clls","updated":"20240614112930"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味与归经】苦，平。归心、肝、脾经。"}]},{"ID":"20240614112930-zkji1xp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112930-zkji1xp","updated":"20240614112930"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功效】活血止痛，消肿生肌。"}]},{"ID":"20240614112930-uqk3x6m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112930-uqk3x6m","updated":"20240614112930"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【临床应用】1.用于脘腹疼痛，风湿痹痛，跌扑伤痛，经行腹痛等症"}]},{"ID":"20240614112930-cfm7pq3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112930-cfm7pq3","updated":"20240614112930"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"没药与乳香的功用相同，故两药经常配合同用以治上述症候。"}]},{"ID":"20240614112930-2kqk695","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112930-2kqk695","updated":"20240614112930"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.用于疮疡肿痛或溃破久不收口"}]},{"ID":"20240614112930-759xey2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112930-759xey2","updated":"20240614112930"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"没药和乳香研末，外敷溃疡，有消肿止痛、去腐生肌的作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240614112930-57qgk72","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112930-57qgk72","updated":"20240614112930"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【处方用名】没药制没药灸没药炒没药（炒去油用）"}]},{"ID":"20240614112930-6a3oyl5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112930-6a3oyl5","updated":"20240614112930"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【一般用量与用法】一钱至三钱，煎服。外用适量。易败胃气，胃弱者慎用。"}]},{"ID":"20240614112930-lq826hn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112930-lq826hn","updated":"20240614112930"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【方剂举例】手拈散（《医学心悟》）没药、延胡、香附、五灵脂。治血积心痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240614112915-qjzymvg","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614112915-qjzymvg"}},{"ID":"20240614112917-77njfc3","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-77njfc3","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《全国中草药汇编》：没药"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-29u4jcv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-29u4jcv","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-v3lw8am","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-v3lw8am","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Mò Yào"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-0cuvbt7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-0cuvbt7","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-kqywvbn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-kqywvbn","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 末药、明没药"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-9bv6evh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-9bv6evh","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-dkkkk35","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-dkkkk35","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 橄榄科没药属植物"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"没药树"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Commiphora myrrha Engl.[C. molmol Engl.]及同属他种植物的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"树干皮部渗出的油胶树脂"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。一般在11月至次年2月间采收，但亦有在6～7月间采收，采收后拣净树皮及其他杂质即得。"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-xjieek9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-xjieek9","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-uayl5sq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-uayl5sq","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 初渗出的为黄白色液体，在空气中逐渐变成为红棕色硬块。"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-1styy28","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-1styy28","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮制"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-y3lfveo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-y3lfveo","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 原药捣碎，炒至焦黑色，待部分挥发油挥发后，稍冷，捣成小块即成。"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-mlchwoa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-mlchwoa","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-9bxyag0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-9bxyag0","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 苦，平。"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-o4yogtx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-o4yogtx","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-hm8fqqz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-hm8fqqz","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 散瘀止痛，外用消肿生肌。用于跌打淤血肿痛，痈疽肿痛，胸腹诸痛；外用治疮口久不收敛。"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-2yy41x4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-2yy41x4","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-0oywsgs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-0oywsgs","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1～4钱；外用适量，配入散剂或膏剂敷贴患处。"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-i3nxm1m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-i3nxm1m","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"备注"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-skx65dk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-skx65dk","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" （1）本品功用与乳香相似，故常相互配伍应用。"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-1dx8xhu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-1dx8xhu","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-7xpwkxp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-7xpwkxp","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《全国中草药汇编》"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-sjq9i98","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-sjq9i98","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中药大辞典》：没药"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-9tytzba","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-9tytzba","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-cw4t44q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-cw4t44q","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Mò Yào"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-ivkqsjr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-ivkqsjr","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-yxvldm8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-yxvldm8","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 末药（《纲目》）"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-7j243ln","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-7j243ln","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-heql6bg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-heql6bg","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《药性论》"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-9bkziee","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-9bkziee","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-8bgkm5l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-8bgkm5l","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 为橄榄科植物"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"没药树"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"或"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"爱伦堡没药树"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"胶树脂"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。11月至翌年2月或6～7月采收。本品多由树皮的裂缝处自然渗出；或将树皮割破，使胶树脂从伤口渗出。初呈黄白色的液体，接触空气后逐渐凝固而成红棕色硬块。采得后去净树皮及杂质，置干燥通风处保存。"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-txuota1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-txuota1","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-pa53tnt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-pa53tnt","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 主产索马里、埃塞俄比亚及阿拉伯半岛南部。以索马里所产者最佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-slo0ww2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-slo0ww2","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-vcamssu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-vcamssu","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①没药树（《大明一统志》）"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-07y5a29","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-07y5a29","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"低矮灌木或乔木，高3米。树干粗，具多数不规则尖刺状的粗枝。树皮薄，光滑，小片状剥落，淡橙棕色，后来灰色。叶散生或丛生，单叶或3出复叶，柄短，小叶倒长卵形或倒披针形，中央一片长7～18毫米，宽4～8毫米，远较两侧一对为大，钝头，全缘或于末端稍具锯齿。花小，丛生短枝上；萼杯状，宿存，上具4钝齿；花冠白色，4瓣，长圆形或线状长圆形，直立；雄蕊8，自短杯状花盘边缘伸出，直立，不等长，花粉囊卵形；子房3室，每室各具胚珠2枚，花柱短粗，柱头头状。核果卵形，尖头，光滑，棕色，外果皮革质或肉质，种子1～3枚，但仅1枚成熟，其余均萎缩。花期夏季。"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-ousbsod","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-ousbsod","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"分布热带非洲和亚洲西部。"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-xaw2sft","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-xaw2sft","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②爱伦堡没药树"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-tmwy37w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-tmwy37w","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"小形无刺乔木或灌木.3出复叶，簇生于短枝上，具长柄，光滑或具短毛，小叶倒卵形或长圆形，先端短尖或钝圆。花1朵或2朵于叶簇旁伸出；花梗中部有小苞片2枚。核果卵形，略压缩，一侧略隆起，短喙状，1室，果皮坚硬，黄色；种子无胚乳。"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-6p6tkiu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-6p6tkiu","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"分布红海两侧的海滨地区，及阿拉伯半岛从北纬22°向南至索马里海滨一带。"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-dupffdf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-dupffdf","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-ig05zgd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-ig05zgd","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 干燥的胶树脂呈不规则颗粒状或粘结成团块，大小不一，一般直径约2.5厘米，有的可达10厘米，红棕色或黄棕色，表面祖糙，覆有粉尘。质坚脆，破碎面呈不规则颗粒状，带棕色油样光泽，并伴有白色小点或线纹，薄片半透明。与水共研则成黄色乳状液。气微弱而芳香，味苦微辛。以块大、棕红色、香气浓而杂质少者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-768mlxr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-768mlxr","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"化学成分"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-kghqrzj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-kghqrzj","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 没药树含树脂25～35％，挥发油2.5～9％，树胶约57～65％，此外为水分及各种杂质约3～4％。"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-9c249r0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-9c249r0","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"树脂的大部分能溶于醚，不溶性部分含α及β罕没药酸，可溶性部分含α，β与γ没药酸、没药尼酸、α与β罕没药酚。尚含罕没药树脂、没药萜醇。"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-5z7at3p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-5z7at3p","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"挥发油在空气中易树脂化，含丁香油酚、间苯甲酚、枯醛、藻烯、二戊烯、柠檬烯、桂皮醛、罕没药烯等。"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-exlg7wk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-exlg7wk","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"树胶水解得阿拉伯糖、半乳糖和木糖。"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-jcc5rc1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-jcc5rc1","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药理作用"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-ivmruhj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-ivmruhj","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 没药的水浸剂（1：2）在试管内对堇色毛癣菌、同心性毛癣菌、许兰氏黄癣菌等多种致病真菌有不同程度的抑制作用。没药的抗菌作用可能与含丁香曲酚有关，参见\"丁香\"条。"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-xn4l5gq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-xn4l5gq","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"含油树脂部分能降低雄兔高胆甾醇血症（饲氢化植物油造成）的血胆甾醇含量，并能防止斑块形成，也能使家兔体重有所减轻。与其他含油树脂的物质相似，没药（一般用酊剂）有某些局部刺激作用，可用于口腔洗剂中，也可用于胃肠无力时以兴奋肠蠕动。"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-8myb4u6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-8myb4u6","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮制"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-uq6rzee","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-uq6rzee","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 没药：拣去杂质，打成碎块。制没药：取拣净的没药置锅内用文火炒至表面稍见熔化点，取出放凉。或炒至表面稍见熔化时，喷洒米醋，继续炒至外层明亮光透，取出放凉。（没药每100斤，用醋6斤）"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-u1p5esv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-u1p5esv","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本草从新》：\"没药，水飞过，用钵坐热水中，以灯心同研，则易细。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-lawxzrk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-lawxzrk","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-sb7rgh6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-sb7rgh6","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 入肝经。"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-rvl9ihk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-rvl9ihk","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本草经疏》：\"入足厥阴经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-w9i391g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-w9i391g","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本草新编》：\"入脾、肾二经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-5j2n5p6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-5j2n5p6","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《本草求真》：\"入心、肝。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-kn6bjbq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-kn6bjbq","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-2z53kiz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-2z53kiz","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 苦，平。"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-88654sr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-88654sr","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《药性论》：\"味苦辛。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-fgg4xlh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-fgg4xlh","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《海药本草》：\"味苦辛，温，无毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-m3b5n01","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-m3b5n01","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《开宝本草》：\"味苦，平，无毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-63wihrw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-63wihrw","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-4kk8yh4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-4kk8yh4","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 孕妇忌服。"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-hz6vtf1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-hz6vtf1","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《品汇精要》：\"妊娠不可服。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-jxhtdns","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-jxhtdns","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本草经疏》：\"凡骨节痛与夫胸腹胁肋痛，非瘀血停留而因于血虚者不宜用。产后恶霹去多，腹中虚痛者不宜用。痈疽已溃不宜用。目赤肤翳非血热甚者不宜用。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-wrdvzvv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-wrdvzvv","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-3r1jqfi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-3r1jqfi","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 散血去瘀，消肿定痛。治跌损，金疮，筋骨，心腹诸痛，症瘕，经闭，痈疽肿痛，痔漏，目障，"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-gh133ya","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-gh133ya","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《药性论》：\"主打搕损，心腹血瘀，伤折踒跌，筋骨瘀痛，金刃所损，痛不可忍，皆以酒投饮之。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-u6qd0wo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-u6qd0wo","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《海药本草》：\"主折伤马坠，推陈置新，能生好血，研烂，以热酒调服。堕胎.心腹俱痛及野鸡漏痔、产后血气痛，并宜丸、散中服。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-6gmizir","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-6gmizir","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《日华子本草》：\"破症结宿血，消肿毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-7fstzqt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-7fstzqt","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《开宝本草》：\"主破血止痛。疗杖疮、诸恶疮、痔漏卒下血、目中翳晕痛肤赤。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-q261j82","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-q261j82","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤王好古：\"治心胆虚，肝血不足。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-zigread","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-zigread","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥《纲目》：\"散血消肿，定痛生肌。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-hcfkdou","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-hcfkdou","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑦《本草述》：\"久服舒筋膜，通血脉，固齿牙，长须发。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-hh5kfah","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-hh5kfah","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-8uj0cby","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-8uj0cby","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：煎汤，1～3钱：或入丸、散。外用：研末调敷。"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-nn3v2yh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-nn3v2yh","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"复方"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-txua5l6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-txua5l6","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①治筋骨损伤：米粉四两（炒黄），入没药、乳香末各半两。酒调成膏，摊贴之。（《御药院方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-o7hd3qp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-o7hd3qp","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治杀伤不透膜者：乳香、没药各一皂子大，研烂，以小便半盏，好酒半盏，同药通口服。（《奇效良方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-8ei3w6w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-8ei3w6w","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③治历节诸风，骨节疼痛，昼夜不可忍者：没药半两（研）；虎胫骨三两（涂酥，炙黄色），先捣罗为散，与没药同研令细。温酒调二钱，日三服。（《本草图经》）"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-yj17b7z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-yj17b7z","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④治一切心肚疼痛，不可忍者：没药、乳香各三钱，川山甲（炙）五钱，木鳖子四钱。上为末，每服半钱至一钱，酒大半盏，同煎温服，不计时候。（《宣明论方》没药散）"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-6qsykdm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-6qsykdm","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤治妇人内伤痛楚，血晕及脐腹疞刺者：没药研细，温酒调一钱。（《本草图经》）"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-4ygi19n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-4ygi19n","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥治产后血晕，语言颠倒，健忘失志：没药、血竭等分。细研为末，产后用童子小便与温酒各半盏，煎一、二沸，调下二钱，良久再服，其恶血自下。（《伤寒保命集》夺命散）"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-334q94i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-334q94i","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑦消血块：滑石二钱，没药一钱，麒麟竭一钱。为末醋糊为丸。（《金匮钩玄》）"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-ok4kjhp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-ok4kjhp","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑧治妇人月水不通：没药半两，硇砂半两，干漆半两（捣碎，炒令烟出），桂心一两，芫花半两（醋拌一宿，炒干），狗胆二枚（干者），水银三分（入少枣肉，研令星尽）。上药，捣罗为末，以枣肉和丸，如绿豆大。每于食前，以温醋汤下十丸。（《圣惠方》没药丸）"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-ugyxzfg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-ugyxzfg","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑨治疗疮、无名肿毒：没药（去油）、辰砂、血竭、硼砂、乳香（去油）、雄黄、蟾酥（人乳浸化）、轻粉、冰片、麝香各等分。共乳细末，用乳捣和丸，如小麦大。每用三丸，含舌下，噙化咽下，出汗自消；如无汗，以热酒催之。（《疡医大全》舌化丹）"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-rca4y9p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-rca4y9p","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑩治痈疽疮毒，腐去新生：乳香、没药各等分。安箬叶上，火炙去油，乳细搽上，以膏贴之。此药毒未尽则提脓外出，如毒巳尽则收口。（《疡医大全》海浮散）"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-thnu5g0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-thnu5g0","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑾治五痔：没药一两（研），黄矾、白矾、溺垽（火煅）各半两，麝香一钱（研）。上五味并研令匀。每用时先以葱汤洗拭净，以药干敷。（《圣济总录》消毒没药散）"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-6sk7clx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-6sk7clx","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑿治漏眼脓血：没药、大黄（蒸，少用）、朴硝。上为末。每服三钱，酒调下，茶亦可。（《银海精微》没药散）"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-e3rpsjs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-e3rpsjs","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒀治血灌瞳人，外障疼痛：没药二两，麒麟竭一两，大黄一两半，芒硝一两半。上捣罗为末，令细。食后热茶调下一钱。（《眼科龙木论》没药散）"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-acxzdqm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-acxzdqm","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"各家论述"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-t8rcnlh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-t8rcnlh","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①《医学入门》：\"东垣云，没药在治疮散血之科。此药推陈致新，故能破宿血，消肿止痛，为疮家奇药也。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-i6w3dlu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-i6w3dlu","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《纲目》：\"乳香活血，没药散血，皆能止痛消肿，生肌，故二药每每相兼而用。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-5t3d8mh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-5t3d8mh","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-ubylmh5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-ubylmh5","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中药大辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-3rbkhf0","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-3rbkhf0","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中华本草》：没药"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-dl78fva","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-dl78fva","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-bw9k47t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-bw9k47t","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Mò Yào"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-2kga4fr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-2kga4fr","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-rhh4roe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-rhh4roe","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 末药。"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-5pde7j0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-5pde7j0","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"英文名"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-9esvtnj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-9esvtnj","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Myrrh"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-m2ois3b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-m2ois3b","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-wka15li","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-wka15li","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 出自《本草图经》。"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-04pfa3y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-04pfa3y","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本草图经》：没药，生波斯国，今海南诸国及广州或有之。木之根、之株，皆如橄榄，叶青而密，岁久者则有膏液流滴在地下，凝结成块，或大或小，亦类安息香。"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-qqp6bt6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-qqp6bt6","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-c4sryg0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-c4sryg0","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 药材基源：为橄榄科植物没药树及同属植物树干皮部渗出的油胶树脂。"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-b6ydzw8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-b6ydzw8","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：Commiphora myrrha Engl.[C.molmol Engl.]"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-afrzzku","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-afrzzku","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采收和储藏：11月至翌年2月采收。树脂可由树皮裂缝自然渗出；或将树皮割破，使油胶树脂从伤口渗出。初呈淡黄白色粘稠液，遇空气逐渐凝固成红棕色硬块。采得后去净杂质，置干燥通风处保存。"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-1z33fff","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-1z33fff","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-0jor1dq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-0jor1dq","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 生态环境：生于海拔500-1500m的山坡地。"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-kujjtn3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-kujjtn3","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"资源分布：分布于热带非洲和亚洲西部。"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-q69b6ve","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-q69b6ve","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-e812mqj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-e812mqj","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 没药树 低矮灌木或乔木，高约3m。树干粗，具多数不规则尖刻状的粗枝；树皮薄，光滑，小片状剥落，淡橙棕色，后变灰色。叶散生或丛生，单叶或三出复叶；小叶倒长卵形或倒披针形，中央1片长7-18mm，宽4-5mm，远较两侧1对为大，钝头，全缘或末端稍具锯齿。花小，丛生于短枝上；萼杯状，宿存，上具4钝齿；花冠白色，4瓣，长圆形或线状长圆形，直立；雄蕊8，从短杯状花盘边缘伸出，直立，不等长；子房3室，花柱短粗，柱头头状。核果卵形，尖头，光滑，棕色，外果皮革质或肉质。种子1-3颗，但仅1颗成熟，其余均萎缩。花期夏季。"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-yz8kxag","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-yz8kxag","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-uxw7uxl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-uxw7uxl","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 性状鉴别 本品呈不规则颗粒状或粘结成团块，直径约2.5cm，有较小或更大的。表面黄棕色至红棕色或黄棕色相间，无光泽或有时无光泽部分与有光泽部分相间。有时夹有树皮、木屑。质坚脆，破碎面颗粒状，有油样光泽，打碎后的薄片有亮光或半透明。气香而特异，味极苦，嚼时粘牙。以块大、棕红色、香气浓、杂质少者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-useqdh6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-useqdh6","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"化学成分"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-jhh73o1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-jhh73o1","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 含树脂25％-35％，挥发油2.5％-9％，树胶约57％-65％，树脂的大部分能溶于醚，不溶性部分a及β罕没药酸（heerabomyrrholic acid），可溶性部分含a、β及γ没药酸（commiphoric acid）没药尼酸（commiphorinic acid）a-及β罕没药酚（heerabomyrrhol），尚含罕没药树脂（heeraboresene），没药萜醇（commiferin）。挥发油在空气中易树脂化，含丁香油酚（eugenol），间甲苯酚（m-cresol），枯醛（cuminaldehyde），蒎烯（pinene），柠檬烯（limonene），桂皮醛（cinnamic aldehyde），罕没药烯（heerabolene）等，并含多种呋喃倍半萜类化合物：8a-甲氧基莪术呋喃二烯（8a-methoxyfuranodiene），8a-乙酸基莪术呋喃二烯（8a-acetylfu-ranodiene），莪术呋喃烯（curzerene，isofruanogermacrene），乌药根烯（lindestrene），呋喃桉-1，3-二烯（furanoeudesma-1，3-diene），莪术呋喃二烯（furanodiene）。反式和顺式4，17（20）-孕甾-3，16-二酮（E，Z-guggulsterone）。树胶水解得阿拉伯糖，半乳糖和木糖。"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-3l464sf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-3l464sf","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药理作用"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-zbz6bxx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-zbz6bxx","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 没药的水浸剂（1：2）在试管内对堇色毛癣菌、同心性毛癣菌、许兰氏黄癣菌等多种致病真菌有不同程度的抑制作用。没药的抗菌作用可能与含丁香油酚有关，参见丁香条。含油树脂部分能降低雄兔高胆甾醇血症（饲氢化植物油造成）的血胆甾醇含量，并能防止斑块形成，也能使家兔体重有所减轻。与其他含油树脂的物质相似，没药（一般用酊剂）有某些局部刺激作用，可用于口腔洗剂中，也可用于胃肠无力时以兴奋肠蠕动。水浸剂用试管稀释法，1：2对堇色毛癣菌等皮肤真菌有抑制作用。所含挥发油对霉菌有轻度抑制作用。没药煎剂20mg/kg股动脉注射，可使麻醉狗股动脉血流量增加，血管阻力下降。"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-vm9rksm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-vm9rksm","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮制"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-2fyx4co","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-2fyx4co","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 没药：拣去杂质，打成碎块。制没药：取拣净的没药置锅内用文火炒至表面稍见熔化点，取出放凉。或炒至表面稍见熔化时，喷洒米醋，继续炒至外层明亮光透，取出放凉（没药每100斤，用醋6斤）；没药，水飞过，用钵坐热水中，以灯心同研，则易细。"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-6bmcsnb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-6bmcsnb","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鉴别"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-b8xh6el","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-b8xh6el","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 理化鉴别 （1）本品与水研磨，形成黄棕色乳状液。"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-qf95ky1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-qf95ky1","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（2）本品已醚浸出物或挥发油置于蒸发皿中，待乙酸挥发散后，皿底的薄膜状残渣用溴或发烟硝酸蒸气熏后，即显紫红色。（检查挥发油）（3）取本品粉末少许，加新鲜配制的香草酸盐酸试液数滴，挥发油含量高者，立即显紫红色，含量低者则初显黄色，渐变成紫红色。（检查挥发油）"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-nxv73xc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-nxv73xc","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-jsdg9dw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-jsdg9dw","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 肝；脾；心；肾经"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-4lvu9vj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-4lvu9vj","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-2z8u1ja","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-2z8u1ja","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 苦；平"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-i7ww3mr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-i7ww3mr","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-r9qlj6k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-r9qlj6k","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.孕妇忌服。"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-ataq4vc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-ataq4vc","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《本草经疏》：凡骨节痛与夫胸腹胁肋痛，非瘀血停留而因于血虚者不宜用。产后恶露去多，腹中虚痛者不宜用。痈疽已溃不宜用。目赤肤翳非血热甚者不宜用。"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-n5kv0a3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-n5kv0a3","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-mtj9b5z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-mtj9b5z","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 活血止痛；消肿生肌。主胸腹瘀痛；痛经；经闭；症瘕；跌打损伤；痈肿疮疡；肠痈；目赤肿痛"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-e36rdet","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-e36rdet","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-inh9bg7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-inh9bg7","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：煎汤，3-10g；或入丸、散。外用：适量，研末调敷。"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-ndz59r0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-ndz59r0","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"各家论述"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-iwl9qr8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-iwl9qr8","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.《本草衍义》：没药，大概通滞血，打扑损疼痛，皆以酒化服。血滞则气壅凝，气壅凝则经络满急，经络满急，故痛且肿。凡打扑着肌肉须肿胀者，经络伤，气血不行，壅凝，故如是。"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-dkml16g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-dkml16g","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《医学入门》：东垣云，没药在治疮散血之科。此药推陈致新，故能破宿血，消肿止痛，为疮家奇药也。"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-i6zmkhm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-i6zmkhm","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《本草纲目》：乳香活血，没药散血，皆能止痛消肿，生肌，故二药每每相兼而用。"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-lu0jjai","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-lu0jjai","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.《本草经疏》：《本草经》，没药味苦平无毒。然平应作辛，气应微寒。凡恶疮痔漏，皆因血热瘀滞而成，外受金刃及杖伤作疮，亦皆血肉受病。血肉伤则瘀而发热作痛，此药苦能泄，辛能散，寒能除热。水属阴，血亦属阴，以类相从，故能入血分，散瘀血，治血热诸疮及卒然下血证也。肝经血热，则目为亦痛、肤翳，散肝经之血热，则目病除矣。"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-uvn9yzk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-uvn9yzk","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.《药性论》：主打扑损，心腹血瘀，伤折跌损，筋骨瘀痛，金刃所损，痛不可忍，皆以酒投饮之。"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-5d5xhvw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-5d5xhvw","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6.《海药本草》：主折伤马坠，推陈置新，能生好血，研烂，以热酒调服。堕胎.心腹俱痛及野鸡漏痔、产后血气痛，并宜丸、散中服。"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-cleg6v4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-cleg6v4","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7.《日华子本草》：破症结宿血，消肿毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-2zgfgrk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-2zgfgrk","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8.《开宝本草》：主破血止痛。疗杖疮、诸恶疮、痔漏卒下血、目中翳晕痛肤赤。"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-ogmpgmm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-ogmpgmm","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"9.王好古：治心胆虚，肝血不足。"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-xh2omph","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-xh2omph","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"10.《本草纲目》：散血消肿，定痛生肌。"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-sqkprwo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-sqkprwo","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"11.《本草述》：久服舒筋膜，通血脉，固齿牙，长须发。"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-4nqkiq5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-4nqkiq5","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240614112917-rxtyvkg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112917-rxtyvkg","updated":"20240614112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240614112918-89b4tgd","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614112918-89b4tgd"}},{"ID":"20240614112920-1hglka3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614112920-1hglka3"}}]}